00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:15,170
Well, I am happy about that.

7526
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:19,090
He summoned me and then, my breasts...

7527
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:22,430
President! I'm really sorry about that!

7528
00:20:22,430 --> 00:20:24,510
And, thank you very much!

7529
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:29,680
Anyways, we managed to follow up
on the molester issue, too.

7530
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:32,440
With this, the school trip will end safely...

7531
00:20:34,020 --> 00:20:36,080
Now we have the school
festival to look forward to.

7532
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:40,610
By the way, the daughter 
of the Phoenix family

7533
00:20:40,610 --> 00:20:43,240
will transfer into Kuoh
Academy around that time.

7534
00:20:43,610 --> 00:20:46,200
Ravel will? Seriously?!

7535
00:20:46,700 --> 00:20:49,910
Yeah, she was greatly
impressed by Rias and Sitri

7536
00:20:49,910 --> 00:20:52,750
and wished to study in Japan.

7537
00:20:52,750 --> 00:20:56,090
She will be a first year like Koneko.

7538
00:20:56,090 --> 00:20:57,670
I don't care.

7539
00:20:57,920 --> 00:21:01,130
That's a sudden transfer. I wonder why?

7540
00:21:01,800 --> 00:21:03,840
Things are tough for all of you.

7541
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,890
Well, it's fine.

7542
00:21:06,890 --> 00:21:10,560
I guess it is enough that you
all have returned safely.

7543
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:14,120
And we have the Rating Game
with Sairaorg to worry about.

7544
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:17,690
We need to focus on our preparations for it.

7545
00:21:17,690 --> 00:21:18,230
Yes!

7546
00:21:20,360 --> 00:21:24,020
I will, with President and everyone,

7547
00:21:28,470 --> 00:21:29,800
be sure to beat Sairaorg!

7548
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:38,210
Did you hear, Sairaorg?

7549
00:21:40,630 --> 00:21:42,880
The rumor that the Red Dragon
Emperor of Rias Gremory

7550
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:45,630
has once again obtained new power.

7551
00:21:46,340 --> 00:21:48,100
How wonderful.

7552
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:51,110
He managed to fight against
the leader of the Hero Faction,

7553
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:55,560
the possessor of the True 
Longinus, and survive.

7554
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:57,770
Of course.

7555
00:21:57,770 --> 00:22:00,550
It would be a problem if he
broke his promise with me.

7556
00:22:00,940 --> 00:22:04,770
Isn't that right, Hyoudou Issei?

